WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.373
For 65 years,

2
00:00:01.373 --> 00:00:03.453
India planned its economy in

3
00:00:03.453 --> 00:00:04.850
five-year plans.

4
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.727
Then the Planning Commission was

5
00:00:06.727 --> 00:00:07.790
replaced.

6
00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.554
The Planning Commission was set

7
00:00:10.554 --> 00:00:12.276
up by a resolution in

8
00:00:12.276 --> 00:00:13.459
March 1950.

9
00:00:13.459 --> 00:00:16.078
The First Plan began in

10
00:00:16.078 --> 00:00:18.573
1951. NITI Aayog replaced the

11
00:00:18.573 --> 00:00:20.605
commission on the first of

12
00:00:20.605 --> 00:00:22.311
January, 2015.

13
00:00:22.641 --> 00:00:24.454
The Nehru years were state-led,

14
00:00:24.454 --> 00:00:26.244
with heavy industry first.

15
00:00:26.244 --> 00:00:27.346
After 1991,

16
00:00:27.346 --> 00:00:29.703
planning became indicative,

17
00:00:29.703 --> 00:00:31.728
and market-friendly.

18
00:00:32.123 --> 00:00:33.960
Unlike the old commission,

19
00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.438
NITI Aayog doesn't allocate funds.

20
00:00:36.438 --> 00:00:37.515
It's meant to be a

21
00:00:37.515 --> 00:00:38.276
think tank,

22
00:00:38.276 --> 00:00:39.458
and a forum for the

23
00:00:39.458 --> 00:00:40.420
states.

24
00:00:41.102 --> 00:00:42.279
Your turn.

25
00:00:42.279 --> 00:00:43.492
When?
